      "text": "BUNDLE = drawer keys you can open + the token's\nECDH private key (+ the write ECDSA key), sealed\nwith HKDF(secret), AES-256-GCM. The server is\nhanded a blob it cannot open.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "90c68e93",
      "originalText": "BUNDLE = drawer keys you can open + the token's\nECDH private key (+ the write ECDSA key), sealed\nwith HKDF(secret), AES-256-GCM. The server is\nhanded a blob it cannot open.",
